sequenceDiagram
    participant FE
    participant API as everfit-api
    participant DB as MongoDB

    FE->>API: GET get-full-list-client-body-metric
    API-->>FE: full catalog, client's shared metrics marked selected

    opt Manage Metric, create a metric not in the catalog
        FE->>API: POST add-new-metric
        API-->>FE: new metric
    end

    alt create new task
        FE->>API: POST v4 add-task, with metrics
        API->>DB: Task.create, metrics saved in the order sent
    else edit existing task
        FE->>API: PUT v3 update-task, with taskId and metrics
        alt already completed by client
            API-->>FE: 400, cannot edit
        else not completed
            API->>DB: updateOne, set metrics
            opt repeating task, This and Upcoming Tasks
                API->>DB: copy metrics to future occurrences
            end
        end
    end
